    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samweli goorgweaksa buuneeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Samweli fuga sean bea Israeli, “Ang'ula, neasinyi ng'asheega sean oorukunean, ak ea neagoonyeegwa sugoocheanda jea ghoahaaghwaneegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa, goong'ulayi, sugoocheanda nukwa gwanda madeedeang'wa; nea aniini ea naawaasiichi ak ea niweeshiit uhuudeanyu, ak goong'ulayi, orjoogeasu goondeawi; ak geendeaydooschi sea agooga ghang'eada damanda eawoosi gheareemaneeda ea ghoah ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aniini geandi hiji; ak ghoahuuyi muushoodiga aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea madeeda siidaanyi simwaar. Neada ea neageandi deedeabeang'a? Ghana neageandi digeedeabeang'a? Ghana ea ng'eaha siida naareachi gidaanyi? Ak ea neasawanyi ng'eaha? Ak ea neageandeawi geatindeabeang'a haleanjeeda seawshooda ak ghwanung' gang'oowiidi gheanyangeasu? Asi amuuwuuni aba badaydeanyu ak gaydawalu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi saawa, “Ang'iing'i mii areadeasa gil ghana sawaneasa ghana geanda gida wassean aba geatinda siida wassean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha niny saawa, “NG'UTAMIIDA muushoocheanda gil aba badahuukeagwa, nea siidaanyi simwaar ea muushoocheanda gil askweareani, gideaba manda gida wassean naanyasi geatindeanyu.” Ak gwayi saawa, “Niny muushoocheanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Samweli buuneeda, “NG'UTAMIIDA muushoocheanda gil, ghayi loat Musa ea Haruni ak gooruuna ghweanigeagwa jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi amiinaada nea goomajeegiichi, ak geargweakseegwa aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gaydargu doobiiwnata sean bea NG'UTAMIIDA ghayi sineegwa ea ghweanigeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda ghayi beawa Yakobo ng'eanyiida Misri ak ghaghabwas fuga Misri saawa, hean gooyeawusa ghweanigeagwa NG'UTAMIIDA ak goojeagu NG'UTAMIIDA Musa ea Haruni, was fuga ghayi aruudu ghweanigeagwa aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri, ak ghoadaw ng'eanyiida goobiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwaroosa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nyaawa; ak ghwashaayda saawa ak ghwayiin geatinga Sisera, was shirikarajeanda haw bea sugoocheanda siguura Yabini bea ng'eanyiida Hasori, ea geatinga fuga Filisti, ea geatinga sugoocheanda Moabu; ak gang'uchi sea saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooyeawusa NG'UTAMIIDA, nea gwayi, ‘Sisinyi riing'eeda, aba gideaba sinung'usi heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak geegadiyeesi Baali ea Ashtaroti; ak ghamneawa gilealnaneasa geatinga weajoodigaasa, ak gajeegadiyeeseey ang'iing'i.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goojeakta NG'UTAMIIDA Yerubaali sea Baraka, ea Yefta, ea Samweli, ak gwalealnaneegwa geatinga weajoodigeagwa aba meadajeega sean; ak goopiitpiichi nea goobeayi seayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama oadaayi Nahashi was sugoocheanda Amoni nea ghwaan ang'ucheewana, gooyeeshiinean, ‘Manda, gayghoahaaghwaneasa sugoocheanda,’ nea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA ea sugoocheandeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa ang'ula sugoocheanda ealoachi, ghayi oomuschiin; ang'ula niyiin NG'UTAMIIDA sugoocheanda madeedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyoosissi mureeda NG'UTAMIIDA nea googadiyeesi nea ghoayiinyi ghuutaanyi ak ea meanung'waadani diigheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea ang'iing'i sea sugoocheanda ahaaghwaneegwa iyoayaachi geeshta NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, gayghwadoabiiw; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea mooleeysiin iit ghuuta NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghoaheawi diigheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, abeeda gayghwahidu geatinda NG'UTAMIIDA badahuukeagwa ea dea ng'utamiideang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi amiinaada nea goomajeekchi geat ak ghoadaayi ng'asheanji haw jea gwasin NG'UTAMIIDA aba madeeda gheanyangeagwean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neada askweareani ea maba lajita ngaanohi? Gaydamwaash NG'UTAMIIDA, ak abeeda ghwanung' ghwahidu giighweandandeeda ea roopta; ak abeeda gajanala nea ghoadaayi gideaba munyindeang'wa aahaw muuchi, ghayi oosinyi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gideaba googasayi sugoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghamwaash Samweli NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghwanung' NG'UTAMIIDA ghwahidu giighweandandeeda ea roopta eaweedida; ak ghoawal buuneesean NG'UTAMIIDA ea Samweli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha buuneesean Samweli, “Mwaasha ASEETA aba badahuuka fugaagu bea gadiyeeda aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, gideaba adiidu geemeewayi; aba gideaba siihaachi aba riing'eegaasa sean ng'asheanji muyiin, ak geegasayi aseasa sugoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Samweli buuneeda, “Adoabeali; agooga noosinyi ng'asheesu sean munyasiin, ak ea adoanung'waadi eadita geeshta NG'UTAMIIDA, agadiyeesiina NG'UTAMIIDA aba gurooruunatkeagwa sean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea adooyamsi geat haleanjeeda mwadaagha mwoamu gwanyakneegwa gil ghana gwalealneegwa, aba gideaba haleanjeeda mwadaagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA mwoamu gwahista fugaaschi, aba hawunda gheawungaaschi gagasa NG'UTAMIIDA ghwanung' ahuwa fugaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aniini, gagasa gwasheagiidanean gideaba gaydasissa riing'eeda NG'UTAMIIDA iyaanung'waadi mooshta ASEETA aba badahuukeagwa; ak gaydaanaaleagwa ng'asheega miyaasiin ea naweeda doabiiw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oawala NG'UTAMIIDA nea gabwageaw, ak gigadiyeesi muuchi aba gurooroadaang'u sean; nea giipkaadi ng'asheega hees nisineey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iidu sina ng'asheega munyas, gajeegul uhuudeang'wa, ang'iing'i ea sugoocheandeang'wa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
